{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52879","headline":"还丹口诀 · 张司马","name":"还丹口诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九九之中乾体开，华池金液自徘徊。\n阴阳鼎上先光彩，铅花鑪里考三才。\n即知造化由人手，术正药真神自来。\n到此修时应出世，四时不用苦相催。\n（五代後蜀人着《大还丹照鉴》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张司马","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52879.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52879","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}